# Frontend

## App Router

- Pages: `frontend/src/app/` — `/`, `/browse`, `/story/[slug]`, `/blindspot`, `/bias`, `/rumors`, **`/verify`**, **`/verify/[slug]`**, **`/verify/database`**, `/pro`, `/sign-in`, `/sign-up`, `/offline`, **`/admin`**, **`/admin/login`**, **`/admin/register`** (internal; `admin/layout.tsx` sets `robots: noindex`)
- Layout: `layout.tsx` wires `ThemeProvider`, `SiteHeader`, `MobileNav`, `InstallPWA`; fonts Inter + Newsreader + Noto Sans Bengali
- Shared UI: `frontend/src/components/`
- Domain helpers: `frontend/src/lib/` (`api`, **`api-base`** (`PUBLIC_API_BASE`, **`SERVER_API_BASE`** / `API_URL` for SSR), **`api-resilience`**, **`claim-input`**, **`auth-input`**, **`admin-input`**, **`admin-host`** (production **`admin.jachai.news`** subdomain; `ADMIN_HOST` / `NEXT_PUBLIC_ADMIN_HOST`), **`admin-proxy-client`**, **`admin-route-auth`**, `stories`, `demo-data`, `perspectives`, `coverage`, **`verifications`**, **`verification-progress`**, **`subscription-plans`**, **`subscription-features`**, **`subscription-entitlement`**, **`subscription-access`**, **`database.types`**, **`supabase.ts`** + **`supabase/client`**, **`server`**, **`service`**, **`config`**, **`supabase/middleware`**, **`security-headers`**, **`auth-errors`**, **`admin-api`**, **`admin-auth`**, **`admin-types`**)
- Resilience UI: `app/error.tsx`, `app/global-error.tsx`; **`ApiDegradedBanner`**, **`ClientErrorBoundary`** in `components/`
- Route handlers: `frontend/src/app/api/admin/` — `login`, `logout`, `ingest`, **`register`**, **`verify`**, **`overview`**, **`sources`**, **`sources/[id]`**; **`app/api/feed/top`** — cached JSON home feed (`getTopStories`); **`app/api/feed/custom-sources`** — cached JSON for admin-added RSS blocks (`getCustomSourceFeeds`). Server-only; never call backend admin/ingest with secrets from the browser
- Auth: `app/auth/callback/route.ts`, `app/api/auth/signout/route.ts`
- `frontend/src/middleware.ts` — on **`admin.jachai.news`** (or `ADMIN_HOST`), rewrites public paths (`/`, `/login`) to internal `/admin/*` and redirects main-site `/admin` to the admin host in production; Supabase session refresh on `/browse`, auth routes, and when `sb-*` cookies exist; legacy cookie **or** Supabase admin for admin UI (except login/register); passes through `/api/admin/*` with security headers only

## Data fetching

- Server components for listings and story pages; prefer **`stories.ts`** helpers over ad hoc `fetchClusters` in pages
- **Home** (`/`): `force-static` shell; **`HomeStoryGridClient`** shows demo slice first, then **`fetch('/api/feed/top')`** (server route calls **`getTopStories`** with `unstable_cache`). **`HomeCustomSourceFeedsClient`** below — **`fetch('/api/feed/custom-sources')`** (no demo fallback; hidden when no blocks and user is not a legacy admin). When **`GET /api/admin/overview`** succeeds (legacy cookie), renders **`AdminSourcesPanel`** `variant="home"` plus feed blocks; listens for **`jachai:admin-refresh`** / **`jachai:custom-feeds-refresh`** (dispatched from **`AdminSourcesPanel`** / ingest). **`FREE_DAILY_TOP_STORIES_LIMIT`** (10) from `subscription-features.ts`
- **`stories.ts`**: `storyFromCluster`, **`storyFromClusterDetail`**, **`resolveStoryBySlug`** (uses `GET /clusters/{slug}`), **`getBrowseClusters`**, **`getRumorsFeed`**, **`getBiasSources`**, **`getLatestArticlesFeed`**, **`getCustomSourceFeeds`** / **`CustomSourceFeedBlock`** (custom sources → per-source **`fetchArticlesFeed`**) — merge API clusters with `demo-data` by slug; fall back to **`DEMO_STORIES`** / **`DEMO_RUMOR_ARTICLES`** when the API is down or empty
- **`api.ts`**: throws on failure (for callers that want exceptions); **`tryApiGet`**, **`tryFetchClusterBySlug`**, **`fetchArticlesFeed`** (optional **`sourceId`**), **`fetchCustomSourcesFeed`** (`/sources?custom_only=true`), **`fetchBiasOverviewFeed`** for optional reads. All GETs use **`fetchJsonSafe`** from **`api-resilience.ts`** (`API_FETCH_TIMEOUT_MS` ≈ 2.5s so SSR fails fast; **`API_WRITE_TIMEOUT_MS`** for POST verify)
- **`claim-input.ts`**: client-side **`validateClaimSubmission`** before **`submitVerification`**
- **`verifications.ts`**: GET list/search use safe fetch (empty + **`fromApi: false`** on failure). **`lookupVerifiedClaim`** → `ok` \| `not_found` \| `unavailable` (use on `/verify/[slug]` — do not 500 when the API is offline). **`fetchVerifiedClaimsFeed`** for database page banner. **`submitVerification`** still throws — writes must not fake success
- Show **`ApiDegradedBanner`** (`compact` under titles when `!fromApi`) on home, bias, rumors, browse, verify database; full banner on verify detail when unavailable
- Client components for interactive UI (meters, tabs, modals, mobile nav, PWA install, theme toggle, **`VerifyClaimForm`** job progress via SSE/WebSocket)

## Resilience (crashes + API downtime)

- **Route errors**: `app/error.tsx` (segment reset + Home); `app/global-error.tsx` (root layout failures). Both report to Sentry when DSN is set
- **Client islands**: wrap risky client trees in **`ClientErrorBoundary`** (e.g. **`StoryTabs`**, **`VerifyClaimForm`**, **`ClaimSearch`**, auth/admin forms, **`AdminIngestPanel`**, **`AdminSourcesPanel`**) so nav/header keep working
- **Reads**: degrade to demo/cached content + banner; **writes** (verify submit, admin, ingest) show real errors
- New listing/detail pages: extend `stories.ts` / `verifications.ts` rather than raw `fetch` in `page.tsx`

## Admin ops (internal)

- **Legacy**: **`ADMIN_USERNAME`** (default `kiron` in dev) + **`ADMIN_PASSWORD`** + optional **`ADMIN_SESSION_SECRET`** → HMAC cookie `jachai_admin`
- **Supabase admin**: **`ADMIN_EMAILS`** allowlist and/or `app_metadata.role === "admin"`; `GET /api/admin/verify` confirms access for Supabase sign-in on `/admin/login`
- **Bootstrap**: **`ADMIN_REGISTRATION_CODE`** + **`SUPABASE_SERVICE_ROLE_KEY`** for `POST /api/admin/register` and `/admin/register`
- **Page vs API auth**: middleware allows Supabase admins into `/admin`; **`isAdminRouteAuthorized`** / **`verifyAdminSession`** on **`/api/admin/overview`**, sources, ingest require the **legacy cookie** (Supabase-only admins need legacy login for dashboard data and source CRUD until handlers are extended)
- **`AdminDashboardPanel`**: client fetch **`GET /api/admin/overview`** → stats + API health + **`AdminSourcesPanel`** (`sources` prop from overview); listens for **`jachai:admin-refresh`** (also from **`AdminIngestPanel`**) to refetch overview
- **`ADMIN_API_KEY`** must match backend when set — `admin-api.ts` sends `X-Admin-Key` for overview and source CRUD
- **`INGEST_API_KEY`** forwarded as `X-Ingest-Key` from `AdminIngestPanel` via `POST /api/admin/ingest` (polls async ingest jobs when API returns 202)
- **`AdminSourcesPanel`**: active vs **disabled** feeds; remove → `DELETE /api/admin/sources/[id]` (**purges** feed articles + orphan clusters, then soft-disable seed or delete custom row); re-add same name to re-enable
- Prefer extending `admin-api.ts` / `admin-types.ts` for new ops endpoints; keep credentials out of client bundles

## Auth, Pro & gating

- Supabase: **`createBrowserSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/client.ts`) for client components; **`createServerSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/server.ts`) in RSC and route handlers; **`createServiceRoleSupabaseClient`** (`supabase/service.ts`) for admin register (service role). Barrel: `lib/supabase.ts`
- Sign-in / sign-up pages under `/sign-in`, `/sign-up` — **`auth-input.ts`** validates credentials; **`safeAuthRedirectPath`** sanitizes `?next=`
- Admin browser writes use **`admin-proxy-client.ts`** (`postAdminRoute`, **`ADMIN_INGEST_CLIENT_TIMEOUT_MS`**) + **`admin-input.ts`** for RSS source forms
- **Free vs Pro matrix**: `lib/subscription-features.ts` (`SUBSCRIPTION_FEATURE_MATRIX`, `PRO_ONLY_FEATURE_IDS`, `featureRequiresPro`, `getFeatureRow`)
- **Entitlement check**: `subscription-entitlement.ts` — `isActiveProSubscription` (`active`/`trialing`, `current_period_end`); `subscription-access.ts` — cached **`getProAccessState()`** / **`hasProAccess()`** via server Supabase + `subscriptions` SELECT; **`NEXT_PUBLIC_MOCK_PRO=true`** forces Pro without a row
- **Browse** (`/browse`): server gate via `hasProAccess()`; free users see `BrowseProGate` + `PaywallModal`; Pro/mock-Pro loads full cluster/article browse
- **Pro marketing**: `/pro` uses `FeatureMatrixTable`, plan cards from `subscription-plans.ts`, checkout still stubbed (`PaywallModal`)
- Pricing/constants: `subscription-plans.ts`; bKash env vars documented in `frontend/.env.example` (server-only when integrated)

## PWA

- `@ducanh2912/next-pwa` in `next.config.ts` (wrapped with `withSentryConfig`); service worker and install prompt in **production** builds only
- Offline shell: `/offline`; `InstallPWA` in root layout
- Generated PWA assets under `frontend/public/` (e.g. `sw.js`, `workbox-*.js`) — build outputs only; do not hand-edit or commit; rebuild after PWA config changes

## Error monitoring (optional)

- `@sentry/nextjs` — `instrumentation.ts` loads `sentry.server.config` / `sentry.edge.config`; browser SDK in `instrumentation-client.ts` at `frontend/` root
- Captures: `app/error.tsx`, `app/global-error.tsx`, **`ClientErrorBoundary`** (`componentDidCatch`)
- Env: `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_DSN`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_ENVIRONMENT`, `NEXT_PUBLIC_SENTRY_TRACES_SAMPLE_RATE`; CI map upload via `SENTRY_ORG`, `SENTRY_PROJECT`, `SENTRY_AUTH_TOKEN` (see `frontend/.env.example`)
- Omit DSN locally — Sentry stays disabled with no runtime cost

## Types

- API shapes: exported from `lib/api.ts`
- Verification: `VerifiedClaim`, `VerifiedClaimLookup`, job event types from `lib/verifications.ts`
- Rich story UI: `Story`, `NewsSource` from `lib/demo-data.ts`
- Supabase: `lib/database.types.ts` — align with `supabase/migrations/`
- Do not duplicate types across components; import from `lib/`

## UI notes

- Light/dark via `next-themes` (`ThemeProvider`, `ThemeToggle`); zinc palette, `font-display` for headings
- Keep BN strings alongside EN where the product already does
- Product components: `StoryFeedCard`, **`HomeStoryGridClient`**, **`HomeCustomSourceFeedsClient`**, **`HomeArchiveLink`**, `HeadlineClashCard`, `HeadlineCompare`, `BiasMeter`, `RumorBadge`, `PerspectiveComparison`, `CoverageBar`, `SourceFilterList`, `StoryTabs`, **`VerifyClaimForm`**, **`ClaimSearch`**, **`BrowseProGate`**, **`FeatureMatrixTable`**, `PaywallModal`, **`ApiDegradedBanner`**, **`ClientErrorBoundary`**, **`AdminDashboardPanel`**, **`AdminIngestPanel`**, **`AdminSourcesPanel`**, **`AdminLogoutButton`**, **`AuthNav`**, **`SignInForm`**, **`SignUpForm`**, shared **`auth-form-styles`** (`components/auth/`, `components/admin/`)
